<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="1. Kiến trúc tổng thể" id="p7437746474147702822"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c1" value="OVC – Kiến trúc tổng thể" style="text;html=1;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="10" width="600" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="Developer" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="205" width="40" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;b&gt;OVC CLI&lt;/b&gt; (ovc)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;1 binary · không cần Git / Oracle Client&lt;br&gt;.ovc/state.json, base/&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="140" y="190" width="180" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="&lt;b&gt;OVC Server&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;• git mirror các schema repo&lt;br&gt;• merge 3 chiều · validate · commit&lt;br&gt;• export DDL (init)&lt;br&gt;• drift check · DB sync&lt;br&gt;• audit log · lock theo branch&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="160" width="240" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="Metadata DB&lt;br&gt;(PostgreSQL)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;schema_repo, job, audit_log,&lt;br&gt;drift_report, sync_run&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=12;fontSize=12;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="240" y="380" width="160" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="&lt;b&gt;GitLab công ty&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;group db/ · 1 repo / schema&lt;br&gt;MR · review · approval&lt;br&gt;protected: main, develop, release/*&lt;br&gt;CI/CD variables (key ghi DB)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="160" width="240" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="&lt;b&gt;GitLab Runner&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px'&gt;ovc deploy --env &amp;lt;env&amp;gt;&lt;br&gt;giữ key ghi DB (masked + protected)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;arcSize=8;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1180" y="190" width="220" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="Oracle &lt;b&gt;dev&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=12;fontSize=12;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="600" width="120" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="Oracle &lt;b&gt;test&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=12;fontSize=12;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="940" y="600" width="120" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="Oracle &lt;b&gt;prod&lt;/b&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=12;fontSize=12;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1120" y="600" width="120" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="&lt;b&gt;Mỗi DB đích&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• OVC_ADMIN: OVC_DEPLOY_LOG, OVC_MIGRATION_LOG&lt;br&gt;• Không dùng trigger chặn DDL:&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;giữ kỷ luật bằng quy ước + drift check" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fillColo